
# Hamsini Ramesh | Personal Portfolio

A personal academic and professional portfolio showcasing my background, experience, projects, certifications and technical skills in Business Intelligence, Data Analytics and Artificial Intelligence.

## About

I am a Computer Science graduate from PES University and an Associate Analytics Consultant at phData.

My experience includes enterprise BI migrations, semantic data modelling, dashboard development, data validation and AI-enabled analytical workflows.

I am interested in exploring the intersection of Data Science and Artificial Intelligence.

## Portfolio Sections

- About – Professional summary
- Education – Academic background
- Experience – Professional experience and internships
- Projects – Academic and technical projects
- Certifications – Professional certifications
- Technical Skills – Programming, analytics and data technologies
- Contact – Professional contact information

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Google Fonts

## Features

- Minimal academic-inspired design
- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile
- Simple navigation between sections
- Lightweight implementation using vanilla JavaScript
- Hosted using GitHub Pages

## Run Locally

1. Clone this repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/YOUR_USERNAME.github.io.git
   ```

2. Open the project folder in VS Code.

3. Open `index.html` in your browser or use the Live Server extension.

